            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.29.35+EXO.29.36+EXO.29.37"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ai 29:35-37",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ewacu ira kumae, Wod dhanu, Rwoth Yehova wacu kumae; Maeni lembapoka mi pemblam i ceng’ ma jubitime i ie, mi thiero lam m’awang’a i wie, man mi kiro rimo i wie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibimio thwon dhiang’ m’aradu ni lam mi dubo, ba julam ma Julawi ma gi nyikwai Zadok, ma gini ceng’ni i kuma, kara gitim ira, Rwoth Yehova wacu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibigamu kum rimone, man ibikethe wi tunge ang’wen, man wi gunde ang’wen mi kume, man wi ruko gbur: ibidwoke leng’ man ibitimo adunya pire kumeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibigamu thwon dhiang’ mi lam mi dubo bende, man jubiwang’e i ka mi ot ma juketho, yo woko ku kamaleng’. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man i ceng’ mir arionde ibithiero koni diel ma mulima mbe i kume ni lam mi dubo; man gibidwoko pemblam leng’, calu gidwoke leng’ ku thwon dhiang’. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kinde m’idaru dwoke leng’, ibithiero thwon dhiang’ m’aradu ma mulima mbe i kume, man nyog rombo ku kind udul rombe ma mulima mbe i kume. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ibikelogi ceng’ni wang’ Yehova, man julam bikonjo kadu i kumgi, man gibithierogi malu ni lam m’awang’a ni Yehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mi ceng’ abiro ibiyiko diel ku ba ceng’ ku ba ceng’ ni lam mi dubo: gibiyiko thwon dhiang’ m’aradu bende, ku nyo g rombo ma kind udul rombe, ma mulima mbe i kume. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gibitimo adunya mi ceng’ abiro pi pemblam man gibidwoke leng’; e gibithiere kumeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man kinde ma gidaru cenge, ebitimbre nia i ceng’ mir aborane, ku m’ucikubino, julam bitimo lam m’awang’a mu wi pemblam, man lam mi kwiocwiny mu; man abijolowu, Rwoth Yehova wacu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.27",
